---
import './Benefits.scss'
---

<section class="benefits" id="benefits-section">
    <div class="benefits__container container">
        <div class="benefits__content">
            <div class="benefits__header">
                <div class="benefits__header-line"></div>
                <span class="benefits__header-label">Benefits</span>
                <div class="benefits__header-line"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="benefits__hero">
                <h2 class="benefits__title">
                    Not just a website.<br />
                    A tool for growth.
                </h2>

                <p class="benefits__subtitle">
                    Built to turn visitors into customers — not just look good.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="benefits__grid">
                <article class="benefits__item">
                    <div class="benefits__item-icon" aria-hidden="true">⚡</div>
                    <h3 class="benefits__item-title">Fast that keeps users</h3>
                    <p class="benefits__item-text">
                        Your website loads instantly, so visitors don’t leave before they even
                        see what you offer.
                    </p>
                </article>

                <article class="benefits__item">
                    <div class="benefits__item-icon" aria-hidden="true">📈</div>
                    <h3 class="benefits__item-title">Built to convert</h3>
                    <p class="benefits__item-text">
                        Clear structure and UX that guide users toward actions — not confusion.
                    </p>
                </article>

                <article class="benefits__item">
                    <div class="benefits__item-icon" aria-hidden="true">🤝</div>
                    <h3 class="benefits__item-title">Product-focused approach</h3>
                    <p class="benefits__item-text">
                        I don’t just code — I help you build something that actually works for your business.
                    </p>
                </article>

                <article class="benefits__item">
                    <div class="benefits__item-icon" aria-hidden="true">🧩</div>
                    <h3 class="benefits__item-title">Easy to scale later</h3>
                    <p class="benefits__item-text">
                        Clean architecture that lets you grow without rebuilding everything from scratch.
                    </p>
                </article>

                <article class="benefits__item">
                    <div class="benefits__item-icon" aria-hidden="true">📱</div>
                    <h3 class="benefits__item-title">Works perfectly everywhere</h3>
                    <p class="benefits__item-text">
                        Smooth experience across mobile, tablet, and desktop without compromises.
                    </p>
                </article>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>